# Setup the Publisher / Subscriber
- Create a node class in src/package_name
- Add dependencies: 
In package.xml, add used in your node code <exec_depend>rclpy</exec_depend>; <exec_depend>std_msgs</exec_depend>

- Add en entry point:
In setup.py and add in entry_points "Node_name = pkg_name.node_file_name:main",

- Build the package:
  cd
  'colcon build --packages-select pkg_name"
  Open new terminal & 'source install/setup.bash'
  Run the node 'ros2 run pkg_name node_name_from_setup'

- Run a launch file: ros2 launch <package_name> <launch_file_name>

