## ROS2_Gazebo Bridging
We have two ways to bridge ROS2 and Gazebo. We can do it in a node (inline) or in a yaml file.
In the launch file, we create a node with the package 'ros_gz_bridge' and in the arguments session, we can write inline the kind of bridge (clock, controller, jsp...) or we can pass a .yaml file where we wrote all the bridge.

